  "description": "Reid Explorer S | 20 inch kids' bike\nLightweight, tough and built for adventure, the Reid Bikes Explorer S 20\" Kids' Bike is designed for children aged 6–9 years. With a durable alloy frame, simple controls and BMX-inspired styling, it's ideal for everyday rides, neighbourhood adventures and family bike trips.\nWide BMX-style tyres provide plenty of grip and stability, while the simple single-speed drivetrain keeps riding easy and fuss-free. A front hand brake and rear coaster brake give young riders intuitive control, helping them build confidence as their cycling skills develop.\nKid-friendly components, including bright grips and a comfortable junior saddle, provide a secure and enjoyable riding position. The lightweight alloy frame makes the bike easier for young riders to handle while remaining tough enough for everyday use.\nWhether they're riding to the park, exploring the neighbourhood or joining a family bike ride, the Reid Bikes Explorer S 20\" is built to make every adventure fun.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Explorer S 20 for?\nThe Explorer S 20\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n6–9 year olds ready for a lightweight 20\" kids' bike\nYoung riders building confidence on two wheels\nChildren who want a fun BMX-inspired style\nRiders learning to use hand and coaster brakes\nParents looking for a durable, easy-to-use kids' bike\nEveryday adventures, from park trips to family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
